   "start": 102,
   "end": 133
  },
  {
   "fact": "死亡的疼比褪掉旧生活更轻。",
   "anchor": "less than shedding her old life",
   "start": 150,
   "end": 181
  },
  {
   "fact": "也比把自己掏空更轻。",
   "anchor": "Less than hollowing herself.",
   "start": 185,
   "end": 213
  },
  {
   "fact": "爱与失去都比死更疼。",
   "anchor": "Less than love, and less than loss.",
   "start": 216,
   "end": 251
  },
  {
   "fact": "与这些相比，死只是一阵微风。",
   "anchor": "it was a breeze",
   "start": 273,
   "end": 288
  },
  {
   "fact": "那阵风像家乡的风，强到可以向后倚着风。",
   "anchor": "like the kind they had back home",
   "start": 302,
   "end": 334
  },
  {
   "fact": "琼此刻在往后退、往下坠。",
   "anchor": "June was going backward now",
   "start": 517,
   "end": 544
  },
  {
